  },
  "question": {
    "text": "The energy associated with electric field is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> and with magnetic field is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> for an electromagnetic wave in free space. Then:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The average energy density of electric field is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>E</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>&#949;</mi><msup><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is the maximum value of electric field.</p><p>The average energy density of magnetic field is given&nbsp;by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is the maximum value of magnetic field.</p><p>The speed of light is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>&#949;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>E</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></math></p><p>As the energy density of electric field and magnetic field are equal, the energy associated for equal volume will also be equal.</p>"
  }
}